{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1094", "sample_idx": 16, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "```json\n{\n  \"famous_moms\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Queen Victoria of the UK 👑\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"Ran the British Empire like a boss from 1837–1901, gave us Victorian everything (technology, manners, and questionable moral compasses). *Also* the great-great-grandma of Queen Elizabeth II. Spoiler: She loved her children *way* too much (9 in total).\",\n      \"mom_energy\": \"Victorian-era sternness meets an obsession with baby photos—like, *1,000* of them. Also, she invented the 'mom glare' (patent pending).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Maya Angelou 🖤✨\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"Poet, activist, and cultural icon who wrote *I Know Why the Caged Bird Sings* and basically used her words like a superpower. Also, she *knew* 5 languages fluently. Try saying that at your next family dinner.\",\n      \"mom_energy\": \"The type who raises you to *dare* to dream big, then hugs you tighter when the world tries to crush those dreams. Also, she’d probably have a *legendary* spice rack.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Cher 💎🎤\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"Iconic singer, actress, and survivor of *Son of the Beast* (aka her childhood). Also, she gave us *Gypsies, Tramps & Thieves* and *Believe*—the song that invented auto-tune. Mom of Elijah and Chastity, aka future stars.\",\n      \"mom_energy\": \"‘If you wanna survive this life, honey, you gotta *sparkle*.’ Also, she’d definitely have a secret stash of vintage wigs in her closet for dramatic moments.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Julia Child 👩🍳🔥\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"Taught the world to *love* butter, booze, and French cuisine via *The French Chef*. Also, she whipped up a soufflé that’d make Michelin stars cry. Mom of *three* boys (plus America’s culinary soul).\",\n      \"mom_energy\": \"‘Mise en place, darling—*organization is key*.’ Also, she’d probably deep-fry your problems away. *Literally.*\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Beyoncé Carter-Knowles 👑🐝\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"Queen Bey, of course—the Grammy-winning, Coachella-closing, *Homecoming* star. Also, mom to *three* tiny superstars: Blue Ivy, Rumi, and Sir. Also, she *wrote* the dictionary definition of ‘slay.’\",\n      \"mom_energy\": \"‘Baby, you’re *flawless*—now go change the world.’ Also, her mom voice is basically the soundtrack to *Lemonade*: fierce, poetic, and *unapologetic*.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"bonus_weird_fact\": {\n    \"about_moms\": \"Did you know Queen Victoria’s daughter *Vicky* (aka Empress Frederick of Germany) once wrote a letter complaining about her *mother-in-law*? Iconic. Also, Julia Child *adopted* a cat named *Marmalade*—because why not?\"\n  }\n}\n```", "logprobs": [{"token": "```", "logprob": -0.0017854715697467327}, {"token": "json", "logprob": -0.00028868322260677814}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.018971888348460197}, {"token": "{\n", "logprob": -0.0038423535879701376}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.008363697677850723}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.0035956748761236668}, {"token": "f", "logprob": -0.45192623138427734}, {"token": "amous", "logprob": -0.14603573083877563}, {"token": "_m", "logprob": -0.018366508185863495}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -0.02863047830760479}, {"token": "\":", "logprob": -0.42201948165893555}, {"token": " [\n", "logprob": -0.12820759415626526}, {"token": "   ", "logprob": -0.0010115751065313816}, {"token": " {\n", "logprob": -0.0029032959137111902}, {"token": "     ", "logprob": -6.603976362384856e-05}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.0006572232232429087}, {"token": "name", "logprob": -0.13792181015014648}, {"token": "\":", "logprob": -0.0011838816571980715}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.03728141635656357}, {"token": "Queen", "logprob": -2.673109531402588}, {"token": " Victoria", "logprob": -1.3838012218475342}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -3.129145383834839}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.13485